      "writtenOn": "2026-08-19T07:16:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This index is derived from labelHead, which may come from label-file text and not always strict fanN format. That could cause false negatives for valid PWM controls on platforms using labels like fan 1. Can we derive the index from the sensor filename fanN_input instead, so mapping to pwmN is more robust?",
      "revId": "6721c2c4170f34311d53103c1ecdefb0a541adc8",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
