      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-08-19T15:26:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Applied. PWM detection now derives the channel index from the sensor filename fanN_input instead of labelHead, so labels like fan 1 no longer cause a false negative while keeping the existing label/config matching behavior intact. Thanks for the catch.",
